1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,124
Speaking, task four. Situation number 21. The examiner will describe a situation. Agree with her, choose one option and say why.

2
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:19,036
Tonight we're cooking dinner together. What shall we make? Any ideas? You can choose from these options.

3
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,265
We can make pizza.

4
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,441
We had pizza yesterday, I want something different.

5
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:34,334
Then how about soup?

6
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,593
Soup takes a long time and I'm very hungry.

7
00:00:38,033 --> 00:00:40,304
OK, then we'll make a salad.

8
00:00:40,767 --> 00:00:42,802
And why do you think that's the best?

9
00:00:43,267 --> 00:00:46,477
Because it's quick and healthy, and we have vegetables at home.

10
00:00:46,933 --> 00:00:50,275
You're right, salad is a good idea. Let's get started.

11
00:00:50,733 --> 00:00:59,822
Practise situation 21 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
